    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeremyaah Oo Beer Iibsaday",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanu waa eraygii Yeremyaah xagga Rabbiga uga yimid sannaddii tobnaad ee Sidqiyaah oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah, oo kaasu wuxuu ahaa sannaddii siddeed iyo tobnaad oo Nebukadresar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa ciidankii boqorka Baabuloon Yeruusaalem hareereeyeen. Oo Nebi Yeremyaahna wuxuu ku xidhnaa barxaddii xabsigii ku dhex yiil gurigii boqorka dalka Yahuudah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Sidqiyaah oo ahaa boqorkii dalka Yahuudah ayaa isaga xidhay, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, War maxaad wax u sii sheegtaa, adigoo leh, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, magaaladan waxaan gelin doonaa gacanta boqorka Baabuloon, oo isna wuu qabsan doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo Sidqiyaah oo ah boqorka dalka Yahuudah gacanta reer Kaldayiin kama uu baxsan doono, laakiinse hubaal waxaa la gelin doonaa gacanta boqorka Baabuloon, oo isna afkiisuu kula hadli doonaa, oo indhahana way isku arki doonaan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo isna Sidqiyaah ayuu u kaxaysan doonaa Baabuloon oo halkaasuu joogi doonaa ilaa aan isaga soo booqdo, ayaa Rabbigu leeyahay; oo in kastoo aad reer Kaldayiin la dirirtaan innaba ma liibaani doontaan?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeremyaahna wuxuu yidhi, Eraygii Rabbiga ayaa ii yimid, oo wuxuu igu yidhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg, waxaa kuu iman doona ina-adeerkaa Xanameel ina Shalluum, oo wuxuu kugu odhan doonaa, Beertayda Canaatood ku taal iga iibso, waayo, adigaa furashada xaq u leh inaad iga iibsatid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa ina-adeerkay Xanameel iigu yimid barxaddii xabsiga sidii erayga Rabbigu ahaa, oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Waan ku baryayaaye beertayda ku taal Canaatood oo dalka reer Benyaamiin ku dhex taal iga iibso, waayo, inaad dhaxasho adigaa xaq u leh, oo furashadeedana adigaa leh, haddaba soo iibso, oo markaasaan ogaaday in kaasu Eraygii Rabbiga yahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaan iibsaday ina-adeerkay Xanameel beertiisii Canaatood ku tiil, oo isagaan lacagtii u miisaamay taasoo ahayd toddoba iyo toban sheqel oo lacag ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intaan warqaddii heshiiska qoray ayaan shaabadeeyey, oo markaasaan markhaatiyaal u yeedhay oo isagaan lacagtii kafado ugu miisaamay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaan qaatay warqadihii heshiiska waxiibsashada, tii shaabadaysnayd iyo tii furnaydba, si waafaqsan sharciga iyo caadada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaan warqaddii heshiiska waxiibsashada u dhiibay Baaruug ina Neeriiyaah oo ka sii ahaa ina Maseeyaah, iyadoo uu u jeedo ina-adeerkay Xanameel, oo waxaan ugu hor dhiibay markhaatiyaashii warqadda heshiiska saxeexay, iyo Yuhuuddii xabsiga barxaddiisa fadhiday oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan Baaruug ku amray hortooda, oo ku idhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu leeyahay, Qaad warqadahan heshiiska waxiibsashada, midda shaabadaysan, iyo tan furanba, oo waxaad ku dhex riddaa jalxad dhooba ah, si ay wakhti dheer u sii raagaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbiga ciidammada oo ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu leeyahay, Weliba mar dambe dalkan waxaa laga iibsan doonaa guryo iyo beero canab ah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaan warqaddii heshiiska waxiibsashada Baaruug ina Neeriiyaah u dhiibay dabadeed ayaan Ilaah baryay oo waxaan ku idhi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidow, Rabbiyow, bal eeg, samada iyo dhulkaba xooggaaga badan iyo gacantaada fidsan ayaad ku samaysay, oo wax kugu adagna ma jiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumanyaal baad u naxariisataa, oo xumaantii aabbayaashu sameeyaanna waxaad abaalmarin ugu soo celisaa laabta carruurtooda iyaga ka dambaysa. Magacaagu waa Ilaaha xoogga badan ee weyn, iyo Rabbiga ciidammada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xagga talada waad ku weyn tahay, oo xagga shuqulkana waad ku xoog badan tahay. Indhahaagu way u furan yihiin jidadka binu-aadmiga oo dhan, si aad mid kasta ugu abaal marisid sidii jidkiisu ahaa iyo sidii midhaha falimihiisu ay ahaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaad ilaa maantadan calaamooyin iyo yaababba ku dhex samaysay dalkii Masar, iyo reer binu Israa'iil dhexdooda, iyo dadka kale dhexdoodaba, oo magac baad samaysatay siday maantadan tahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkaaga reer binu Israa'iilna dalkii Masar baad kaga soo bixisay calaamooyin, iyo yaabab, iyo gacan xoog badan, iyo dhudhun fidsan, iyo cabsi weyn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagaad siisay dalkan aad awowayaashood ugu dhaaratay inaad iyaga siinaysid kaasoo ah dal caano iyo malab la barwaaqaysan, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oo iyana intay soo galeen ayay hantiyeen, laakiinse codkaagii ma ay addeecin, oo sharcigaagiina kuma ay socon, oo waxyaalihii aad ku amartay inay sameeyaanna waxba kama ay samayn, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaad ka dhigtay in masiibadan oo dhammu ay ku dhacdo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal eeg tuulmooyinka! Magaalada waa loo yimid in la qabsado, oo waxaa magaaladii la geliyey gacantii reer Kaldayiinkii iyada la diriray, waana seefta iyo abaarta iyo belaayada aawadood. Wixii aad ku hadashay way ahaadeen, oo bal eeg, adiguba waad u jeeddaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidow, Rabbiyow, waxaad igu tidhi, Beerta lacag ku iibso, oo markhaatiyaal u yeedh, waayo, magaalada waxaa lagu riday gacanta reer Kaldayiin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
