            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Bal ogaada, Anigu magaaladan waxaan gelin doonaa gacanta reer Kaldayiin, iyo gacanta Nebukadresar oo ah boqorka Baabuloon, oo isna wuu qabsan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo reer Kaldayiinka magaaladan la dirirayaana way iman doonaan, oo dab bay magaaladan qabadsiin doonaan, oo way gubi doonaan iyada iyo guryaheedii ay saqafkooda Bacal foox ugu shidi jireen, oo ay qurbaanno cabniin ah ilaahyada kale ugu shubi jireen, oo sidaasay iiga cadhaysiiyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, dadka Israa'iil iyo dadka Yahuudahba waxay tan iyo yaraantoodii hortayda ku sameeyeen shar keliya, waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Reer binu Israa'iil waxaa keliya oo ay sameeyeen inay shuqulka gacmahooda igaga cadhaysiiyaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, magaaladanu waxay ii ahayd wax iga dhirfiya oo iga cadhaysiiya tan iyo maalintii ay dhiseen iyo ilaa maantadan la joogo inta ka dhex leh, oo sidaas daraaddeed ayaan wejigayga uga hor fogayn doonaa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waana sharkii dadka Israa'iil iyo dadka Yahuudah ay igaga cadhaysiiyeen oo dhan, iyaga, iyo boqorradooda, iyo amiirradooda, iyo wadaaddadooda, iyo nebiyadooda, iyo dadka Yahuudah, iyo kuwa Yeruusaalem deggan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyagu dhabarkay ii soo jeediyeen, wejigiina way iga sii jeediyeen, oo in kastoo aan iyaga wax baray, anigoo goor wanaagsan wax baraya, inay tacliin qaataan innaba ma ay dhegaysan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse karaahiyooyinkoodii ayay dhex qotomiyeen gurigii laygu magacaabay gudihiisa oo sidaasay u nijaaseeyeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba waxay dhiseen meelaha sarsare ee Bacal oo ku dhex yaal dhooxada ina Xinnom si ay wiilashooda iyo gabdhahoodaba dab u dhex marsiiyaan Moleg aawadiis, taasoo aanan iyaga ku amrin, oo aan innaba qalbigayga soo gelin, inay karaahiyadan sameeyaan oo ay dadka Yahuudah dembaajiyaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba sidaas daraaddeed Rabbiga ah Ilaaha reer binu Israa'iil wuxuu ka leeyahay magaaladan aad tidhaahdeen, Waxay boqorka Baabuloon ugu gacangeli doontaa seef iyo abaar iyo belaayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bal ogaada, waxaan iyaga ka soo dhex ururin doonaa waddammadii aan xanaaqayga iyo dhirifkayga iyo cadhada weyn ugu kexeeyey oo dhan, oo meeshan ayaan mar kale ku soo celin doonaa, oo waxaan ka dhigi doonaa inay ammaan ku degganaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyagu waxay ahaan doonaan dadkaygii, oo anna Ilaahood baan ahaan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan iyaga siin doonaa qalbi qudha iyo jid qudha, si ay weligoodba iiga cabsadaan, waana inay iyaga iyo carruurtooda ka dambaysaba wanaag helaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaan iyaga la dhigan doonaa axdi weligiisba sii waaraya, si aanan marnaba uga sii jeesan inaan iyaga wanaag u sameeyo, oo qalbigooda ayaan cabsidayda gelin doonaa, si ayan iiga tegin aawadeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waxaan ku farxi doonaa inaan iyaga wanaag u sameeyo, oo sida runta ah qalbigayga oo dhan iyo naftayda oo dhan ayaan iyaga dalkan ku dhex beeri doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waayo, Rabbigu wuxuu leeyahay, Sidaan dadkan ugu soo dejiyey masiibadan weyn oo dhan ayaan wanaaggii aan u ballanqaaday oo dhan ugu soo dejin doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo beeraa laga iibsan doonaa dalkan aad tidhaahdaan, Waa cidla aan dad iyo duunyo toona lahayn oo waxaa lagu riday gacanta reer Kaldayiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 32:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dad baa beero lacag kaga iibsan doona dalka reer Benyaamiin iyo meelaha Yeruusaalem ku wareegsan oo dhan, iyo magaalooyinka dalka Yahuudah, iyo magaalooyinka buuraha ku yaal, iyo magaalooyinka dooxada ku yaal, iyo magaalooyinka koonfureedba, oo warqadda heshiiskana way qori doonaan oo shaabadayn doonaan, oo markhaatiyaalna way u yeedhi doonaan, waayo, anigu maxaabiistooda waan soo celin doonaa ayaa Rabbigu leeyahay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.32.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
